  "title": "CORMEDIX THERAPEUTICS ANNOUNCES SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM",
  "summary": "Berkeley Heights, NJ – February 2, 2026 – CorMedix Therapeutics (Nasdaq: CRMD), a biopharmaceutical company focused on developing and commercializing therapeutic products for life-threatening diseases and conditions, today announced its Board of Directors has approved a share repurchase program, which authorizes the Company to repurchase up to $75 million of the Company’s outstanding common stock. The […]",
